WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

00:06.580 --> 00:07.980
[Respect Copyright; Everyone's Responsibility]

00:08.360 --> 00:09.800
♪Data is screaming♪

00:09.800 --> 00:11.330
♪Proposals are burning♪

00:11.330 --> 00:13.200
♪I deconstruct the world's algorithms♪

00:13.200 --> 00:14.900
♪Only never counting the heartbeat♪

00:14.900 --> 00:17.160
♪Whose perfect smile is reflected in the glass?♪

00:17.160 --> 00:18.760
♪Treading on shadows as I run ahead♪

00:18.760 --> 00:20.300
♪There's no time to fall♪

00:20.330 --> 00:23.000
♪They say gears should be obedient♪

00:23.100 --> 00:25.660
♪Yet I insist on being the offbeat stopwatch♪

00:25.800 --> 00:29.040
♪Planting my own pride in the cracks of the rules♪

00:29.200 --> 00:31.800
♪Waiting for the night to grow its dawn♪

00:33.200 --> 00:35.930
♪I am my own irreplaceable coordinate♪

00:35.930 --> 00:37.280
♪No claimed ground, no comparison♪

00:37.280 --> 00:38.660
♪I won't be anyone's footnote♪

00:38.660 --> 00:40.040
♪Though there are thousand of templates♪

00:40.040 --> 00:41.730
♪I choose only the sharpest second♪

00:41.730 --> 00:44.100
♪Answering life as my own thinking question♪

00:44.100 --> 00:46.860
♪I am my own never-landing beacon♪

00:46.860 --> 00:48.320
♪No borrowed light, no offered prayer♪

00:48.320 --> 00:49.530
♪I won't believe in anyone's castle♪

00:49.530 --> 00:50.960
♪Even if the world is an exam hall♪

00:50.960 --> 00:52.800
♪I'll hand in early and run away♪

00:52.800 --> 00:54.100
♪Writing in one single line for the answer♪

00:54.460 --> 00:55.820
♪"I dare to claim it!"♪

01:05.440 --> 01:07.860
♪I am my own irreplaceable coordinate♪

01:07.860 --> 01:09.400
♪No substitute, no imitation♪

01:09.400 --> 01:10.560
♪I won't trade for anyone's glory♪

01:10.560 --> 01:12.040
♪Though there are thousands of echoes♪

01:12.040 --> 01:13.700
♪I listen only to the loneliest second♪

01:13.700 --> 01:16.000
♪Walking life into my own exclamation mark♪

01:16.000 --> 01:18.760
♪I am my own never-extinguishing lamp♪

01:18.760 --> 01:20.360
♪No wind‑borne drift, no shore‑bound rest♪

01:20.360 --> 01:21.700
♪I won't linger in anyone's course♪

01:21.700 --> 01:23.160
♪Even if there are millions of scripts♪

01:23.160 --> 01:24.960
♪I'll tear them up and rewrite today♪

01:24.960 --> 01:26.060
♪Signing the signature at the end with only♪

01:26.380 --> 01:27.740
♪"I create it!"♪

01:33.400 --> 01:37.980
[Irreplaceable]

01:37.980 --> 01:40.980
[Episode 20]

01:42.790 --> 01:43.770
It's the middle of the night.

01:44.310 --> 01:45.130
Who are you talking to,

01:45.200 --> 01:46.020
some young hottie?

01:49.950 --> 01:50.820
Smells like jealousy.

01:52.640 --> 01:53.210
Come on, who is it?

01:53.840 --> 01:54.290
Look.

01:55.760 --> 01:56.540
It's Xu Chi.

01:56.680 --> 01:57.690
We were talking about All Buy.

02:00.150 --> 02:00.770
You

02:01.000 --> 02:02.540
are way too good to Xu Chi.

02:02.790 --> 02:03.690
Better than you are to me.

02:04.510 --> 02:05.100
How about

02:05.150 --> 02:06.130
you make it up to me this weekend?

02:06.480 --> 02:07.740
Come paragliding with me.

02:08.240 --> 02:08.540
And

02:08.590 --> 02:09.660
I can teach you kayaking too.

02:11.030 --> 02:12.220
You've got my schedule.

02:12.310 --> 02:13.380
I'm traveling for work this week.

02:14.430 --> 02:15.340
Traveling again?

02:19.150 --> 02:20.290
I've told you before,

02:20.910 --> 02:22.450
your foreign consulting firms

02:22.750 --> 02:23.940
are past their prime.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.660
Consultant?

02:25.960 --> 02:26.780
Sounds fancy.

02:27.120 --> 02:27.890
But honestly, they're not even

02:28.000 --> 02:29.290
as good as a project manager at my company.

02:30.400 --> 02:30.980
How about this?

02:31.120 --> 02:32.010
I'll find you a high-paying,

02:32.240 --> 02:34.220
easy job at my company.

02:37.840 --> 02:38.410
Shen Jin,

02:39.030 --> 02:40.260
this is the fourth time

02:40.310 --> 02:40.890
in two months

02:40.960 --> 02:42.010
you've disrespected my job.

02:42.360 --> 02:43.380
They say three strikes and you're out.

02:43.750 --> 02:44.410
You've gone too far.

02:44.870 --> 02:46.220
How did I disrespect you?

02:46.520 --> 02:48.060
I was being honest.

02:48.520 --> 02:49.450
My career is my own choice,

02:49.520 --> 02:50.820
good or bad.

02:51.080 --> 02:52.170
Keep your judgments to yourself.

02:55.150 --> 02:55.380
And

02:55.400 --> 02:56.410
there are lines you just don't cross,

02:56.520 --> 02:57.130
you know?

02:57.240 --> 02:58.380
You've crossed them way too many times.

02:58.430 --> 02:59.450
I've put up with you long enough.

02:59.680 --> 03:00.380
I'm busy with work,

03:00.560 --> 03:01.850
but I've taken time off plenty of times

03:01.960 --> 03:02.690
to go out with you.

03:03.000 --> 03:03.500
But you?

03:04.280 --> 03:04.850
I told you

03:04.870 --> 03:05.690
I get seasick and I'm scared of heights.

03:05.710 --> 03:06.610
You don't care at all!

03:06.840 --> 03:07.690
Before, you dragged me into the water.

03:07.750 --> 03:09.410
Now paragliding.

03:09.470 --> 03:10.730
Did you ever think about how I feel?

03:11.470 --> 03:12.290
What did I say?

03:12.310 --> 03:13.850
You're just taking it out on me.

03:15.120 --> 03:16.730
What, are you going through the change?

03:18.800 --> 03:20.780
Yeah! I am going through the change!

03:20.870 --> 03:21.340
Get out!

03:21.960 --> 03:22.340
Out!

03:22.910 --> 03:23.500
Get out right now!

03:23.590 --> 03:24.660
Where... where am I supposed to go?

03:25.030 --> 03:25.730
Wait, Long...

03:25.800 --> 03:26.500
Don't ever come back!

03:26.590 --> 03:27.660
Why are you actually mad?

03:27.710 --> 03:28.540
That's not what I meant.

03:29.080 --> 03:29.380
Hey,

03:29.630 --> 03:30.690
where am I supposed to go right now?

03:30.750 --> 03:32.170
I don't even have shoes.

03:33.470 --> 03:33.940
Long.

03:38.430 --> 03:39.690
What good is just giving me

03:39.710 --> 03:40.410
a pair of shoes?

03:40.750 --> 03:41.290
It's so late.

03:41.360 --> 03:41.980
I don't have my phone.

03:42.000 --> 03:43.100
Where am I gonna go?

03:43.630 --> 03:44.170
I don't care!

03:44.710 --> 03:45.610
Go wherever you want!

04:15.750 --> 04:16.610
Your wife

04:17.040 --> 04:18.460
kicked you out in the middle of the night?

04:19.240 --> 04:19.850
Girlfriend.

04:20.560 --> 04:21.290
Why?

04:22.070 --> 04:22.780
I just said she was going

04:22.800 --> 04:23.780
through the change, and she...

04:24.120 --> 04:24.700
Wait... hold on.

04:25.950 --> 04:26.660
Even if

04:27.390 --> 04:28.140
you give me a bad rating for this,

04:28.190 --> 04:28.930
I still have to say it.

04:29.800 --> 04:30.370
You

04:30.560 --> 04:31.340
are out of line.

04:32.720 --> 04:33.850
It was just the heat of the moment.

04:34.360 --> 04:34.850
Middle of the night.

04:34.950 --> 04:35.540
Brain's all foggy.

04:36.070 --> 04:36.610
Still,

04:36.630 --> 04:38.170
there are things you just don't say.

04:38.830 --> 04:39.980
If that were my wife,

04:40.390 --> 04:41.370
she'd already be talking divorce.

04:44.240 --> 04:44.610
Sir.

04:45.070 --> 04:45.930
Turn around and go back.

04:46.390 --> 04:47.780
No, you absolutely cannot go back now.

04:48.240 --> 04:49.220
She's still furious.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.170
Apologizing now just makes it worse.

04:51.680 --> 04:52.250
Trust me.

04:52.870 --> 04:53.980
Wait till tomorrow. Bring her something.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.290
That's what shows you mean it.

04:55.720 --> 04:56.610
By tomorrow, your girlfriend

04:56.680 --> 04:57.730
will have cooled down.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.290
The second she sees you showing up

04:59.480 --> 05:00.140
with flowers

05:00.510 --> 05:01.100
and a diamond ring,

05:01.360 --> 05:02.700
she'll definitely snap right out of it.

05:04.680 --> 05:06.020
Flowers and a diamond ring?

05:09.600 --> 05:14.360
[All Buy]

05:14.430 --> 05:15.250
We've always believed

05:15.680 --> 05:16.490
the best crisis PR

05:16.680 --> 05:18.660
is honesty and authenticity.

05:19.630 --> 05:21.050
That's why we dared to

05:21.310 --> 05:22.540
invite everyone to see

05:22.680 --> 05:24.050
our AI strategy in action

05:24.120 --> 05:25.170
the very next day

05:25.390 --> 05:25.980
after the incident.

05:27.000 --> 05:27.930
What you're seeing now

05:28.190 --> 05:29.290
is a live feed of our warehouse

05:29.560 --> 05:30.140
sorting operation.

05:34.560 --> 05:35.660
It takes

05:35.680 --> 05:36.700
a lot of courage

05:37.040 --> 05:38.290
to lay its logistics operations bare.

05:48.360 --> 05:49.250
As an internationally renowned

05:49.310 --> 05:50.290
consulting firm,

05:50.630 --> 05:52.370
Hezong worked closely with All Buy

05:52.920 --> 05:54.170
and introduced a comprehensive

05:54.270 --> 05:55.140
AI advisory plan

05:55.160 --> 05:56.020
for their overseas operations.

05:56.190 --> 05:57.610
We're also glad to learn

05:58.000 --> 05:59.020
that All Buy has brought this plan

05:59.040 --> 05:59.610
into its

05:59.720 --> 06:00.610
domestic business departments too.

06:00.950 --> 06:01.780
So you used

06:01.800 --> 06:02.460
this AI plan

06:02.480 --> 06:03.780
to push Mr. Liu to the brink?

06:03.830 --> 06:04.730
He's in his forties.

06:04.920 --> 06:05.540
He worked at All Buy

06:05.600 --> 06:06.370
for over a decade.

06:06.720 --> 06:07.490
And he was let go just like that.

06:08.000 --> 06:08.540
Some top-tier

06:08.560 --> 06:09.850
consulting firm you are.

06:10.000 --> 06:10.810
Are you

06:10.870 --> 06:12.100
Consultant Ye?

06:15.830 --> 06:16.700
Our team

06:17.600 --> 06:18.050
has never had

06:18.070 --> 06:18.980
a consultant surnamed Ye.

06:19.950 --> 06:21.370
The project lead

06:21.390 --> 06:22.980
has always been me, Xu Chi.

06:23.480 --> 06:24.050
So did you ever

06:24.120 --> 06:25.250
go to Mr. Liu

06:25.270 --> 06:26.100
and apologize?

06:30.600 --> 06:31.930
First, Mr. Liu

06:32.270 --> 06:33.250
is out of the ICU.

06:33.270 --> 06:34.220
He's not in any danger.

06:34.950 --> 06:36.780
And he'll recover soon.

06:37.510 --> 06:37.930
Second,

06:39.630 --> 06:40.170
we don't think

06:40.190 --> 06:41.370
there's any need for an apology.

06:45.190 --> 06:46.460
That's just cold.

06:48.510 --> 06:49.220
Everyone, please calm down.

06:49.720 --> 06:50.250
Before that,

06:50.270 --> 06:51.580
I'd like to ask you all something.

06:52.190 --> 06:53.660
When you edit videos,

06:53.750 --> 06:55.700
have you ever used smart editing,

06:56.190 --> 06:58.220
voice recognition, or auto captions?

07:00.560 --> 07:01.460
Do you think those

07:01.510 --> 07:02.460
AI tools

07:02.870 --> 07:03.850
made you lose your jobs

07:04.160 --> 07:05.580
or cut your income?

07:07.040 --> 07:08.050
The same goes

07:08.190 --> 07:09.250
for All Buy's AI.

07:09.750 --> 07:10.780
It was never meant

07:10.870 --> 07:12.170
to replace human jobs.

07:12.430 --> 07:13.250
It's just a tool

07:13.310 --> 07:14.490
to boost efficiency.

07:15.240 --> 07:16.170
Based on our projections,

07:16.630 --> 07:17.850
after All Buy adopts

07:18.160 --> 07:19.370
a full AI strategy,

07:20.070 --> 07:21.050
logistics delivery speed

07:21.310 --> 07:22.660
will increase by 37%.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.140
Quality inspection pass rates

07:24.270 --> 07:25.610
will go up by 21%.

07:26.120 --> 07:26.850
That means

07:27.070 --> 07:28.020
East Sea swimming crabs

07:28.190 --> 07:29.460
will reach your dinner table

07:29.870 --> 07:31.290
two hours earlier.

07:32.240 --> 07:32.850
Everyone, take a look.

07:42.390 --> 07:42.980
With an AI system

07:43.000 --> 07:43.610
like this,

07:43.830 --> 07:45.250
won't the fruit we get

07:45.270 --> 07:46.410
from online shopping

07:46.510 --> 07:47.700
be more reliably good?

07:48.070 --> 07:48.460
In the future,

07:49.160 --> 07:50.980
All Buy branches worldwide

07:51.190 --> 07:51.810
will roll out

07:52.040 --> 07:52.730
this AI system.

07:53.510 --> 07:54.580
But what does All Buy's

07:54.630 --> 07:55.290
rapid growth

07:55.430 --> 07:56.220
have to do

07:56.240 --> 07:56.980
with actual people?

07:57.270 --> 07:57.900
Mr. Liu

07:57.950 --> 07:59.370
did lose his job.

07:59.600 --> 08:00.810
I'd like to ask everyone

08:00.830 --> 08:01.460
another question.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.170
Statistics show

08:03.270 --> 08:04.050
only 1%

08:04.070 --> 08:04.410
of people

08:04.480 --> 08:05.610
over fifty

08:05.870 --> 08:07.020
know how to use

08:07.040 --> 08:07.700
ride-hailing apps.

08:08.240 --> 08:09.220
So what should we do?

08:09.430 --> 08:10.810
Question whether ride-hailing

08:10.870 --> 08:11.700
should abandon them,

08:11.950 --> 08:14.050
or help them learn

08:14.270 --> 08:15.220
this new skill?

08:16.870 --> 08:17.340
Of course,

08:17.630 --> 08:19.140
we also need to reflect seriously.

08:19.720 --> 08:20.540
Because during

08:21.070 --> 08:22.250
the company's upgrades,

08:22.390 --> 08:23.250
we didn't do well enough.

08:23.600 --> 08:25.410
We weren't careful enough.

08:25.720 --> 08:26.850
Our idea

08:27.070 --> 08:28.490
was to help employees upgrade

08:28.630 --> 08:29.580
with AI.

08:30.680 --> 08:31.170
But

08:31.240 --> 08:32.130
communication broke down.

08:33.360 --> 08:34.340
And Mr. Liu mistook it

08:34.630 --> 08:35.100
as an excuse

08:35.120 --> 08:36.340
to push him out.

08:36.670 --> 08:37.940
That's how this tragedy happened.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.610
But as you can see,

08:39.960 --> 08:40.980
our workflow

08:41.320 --> 08:42.130
just has quality inspectors

08:42.270 --> 08:42.890
pull out the fresh goods

08:42.960 --> 08:44.490
that fail the AI video pre-check

08:44.670 --> 08:45.700
for a re-check.

08:45.960 --> 08:47.370
We never forced anyone

08:47.600 --> 08:48.300
to learn

08:48.360 --> 08:50.010
complicated computer operations.

08:51.240 --> 08:52.340
As a local consulting firm,

08:52.480 --> 08:53.530
we've always believed

08:53.720 --> 08:54.980
that only by doing our best to boost

08:55.080 --> 08:56.420
everyone's efficiency and wealth

08:56.910 --> 08:57.890
can we keep every ordinary person

08:57.910 --> 08:59.130
from being left behind by the times.

08:59.750 --> 09:01.490
Of course, not making a public apology

09:01.510 --> 09:02.130
doesn't mean

09:02.150 --> 09:03.730
we're not sad,

09:04.030 --> 09:05.700
not reflecting, not taking responsibility,

09:06.000 --> 09:07.490
or not doing everything we can to help.

09:08.240 --> 09:08.730
So

09:08.790 --> 09:10.700
after discussing with All Buy,

09:11.000 --> 09:12.490
we've made the following decisions.

09:13.120 --> 09:13.340
First,

09:13.630 --> 09:14.820
all of Mr. Liu's hospital

09:14.840 --> 09:15.460
and rehab costs

09:15.670 --> 09:16.460
will be covered

09:16.630 --> 09:17.530
by the company.

09:17.870 --> 09:19.700
And during his medical leave,

09:20.000 --> 09:21.100
he'll get an extra 200 yuan a day

09:21.150 --> 09:21.730
in rehab allowance

09:22.030 --> 09:23.180
until he returns

09:23.240 --> 09:24.100
to his job.

09:24.720 --> 09:25.060
Second,

09:25.510 --> 09:26.370
we promise

09:26.600 --> 09:27.340
not to fire

09:27.630 --> 09:29.010
any frontline employee

09:29.390 --> 09:30.460
over something like this

09:30.600 --> 09:31.370
for three years.

09:31.630 --> 09:32.340
And we hope

09:32.630 --> 09:33.850
you'll all keep an eye on us.

09:34.200 --> 09:34.610
Third,

09:34.870 --> 09:37.530
All Buy and Hezong Consulting

09:37.790 --> 09:39.100
will jointly donate ten million

09:39.550 --> 09:40.370
to set up

09:40.510 --> 09:41.700
the All-He Digital Adaptation Fund

09:41.840 --> 09:43.010
for Senior Employees,

09:43.440 --> 09:44.010
to help workers

09:44.360 --> 09:45.730
over forty

09:46.080 --> 09:47.530
adapt faster

09:47.840 --> 09:49.130
to the industry's AI shift.

09:49.630 --> 09:50.490
Because we know

09:50.870 --> 09:52.460
that in a company,

09:53.550 --> 09:55.130
people come first.

09:55.510 --> 09:56.130
All Buy's

09:56.390 --> 09:58.100
most irreplaceable asset

09:58.390 --> 09:59.130
isn't our

09:59.790 --> 10:00.820
expensive AI equipment.

10:01.150 --> 10:02.340
It's every single one

10:02.790 --> 10:03.820
of our employees.

10:21.080 --> 10:21.770
I wonder if Richard

10:21.840 --> 10:23.220
will be happy with how this turned out.

10:24.120 --> 10:24.850
Once this is over,

10:25.030 --> 10:26.130
I'll go explain it to him right away.

10:27.670 --> 10:29.130
We'll make it clear to him.

10:29.630 --> 10:29.940
Having you

10:30.000 --> 10:31.100
appear before the public

10:31.120 --> 10:32.340
as the project lead

10:32.600 --> 10:34.010
was the whole team's decision.

10:34.390 --> 10:35.610
For consultants,

10:35.670 --> 10:36.850
public trust is everything.

10:37.030 --> 10:37.610
You took

10:37.630 --> 10:39.250
all the blame for Richard.

10:39.510 --> 10:40.010
You're betting

10:40.080 --> 10:41.580
your entire career to protect him.

10:42.720 --> 10:43.940
But emotionally,

10:44.360 --> 10:45.300
he's still going to be hurt.

10:47.390 --> 10:49.370
So, did Mr. Liu's family

10:49.550 --> 10:50.370
get the donation?

10:50.790 --> 10:51.220
Yes.

10:52.150 --> 10:53.890
You donated 150,000.

10:54.030 --> 10:54.940
Plus what everyone else donated,

10:55.080 --> 10:56.890
that's 209,700 in total.

10:57.000 --> 10:57.610
All transferred.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.980
I'll go see him in a few days.

11:01.120 --> 11:01.890
See if there's anything else

11:01.910 --> 11:02.580
he needs.

11:06.080 --> 11:06.980
The next focus

11:07.080 --> 11:08.060
is following up

11:08.120 --> 11:09.180
on how traditional media reacts.

11:09.720 --> 11:10.060
Okay.

11:10.840 --> 11:11.220
Got it.

11:35.480 --> 11:35.980
Hello.

11:36.320 --> 11:36.820
Ye.

11:37.080 --> 11:37.980
That's great.

11:38.150 --> 11:39.490
Amazing, really.

11:39.960 --> 11:41.100
When I saw the news yesterday,

11:41.150 --> 11:41.460
I knew

11:41.480 --> 11:42.730
you had to be dealing with all this mess,

11:42.750 --> 11:43.610
so I didn't wanna bother you.

11:43.840 --> 11:44.820
Who would've thought?

11:45.030 --> 11:46.770
Overnight, everything turned around.

11:48.030 --> 11:49.420
I took three melatonin pills last night.

11:49.790 --> 11:50.220
My brain

11:50.240 --> 11:51.130
still hasn't caught up.

11:51.360 --> 11:53.100
What are you talking about? I don't get it.

11:53.240 --> 11:55.180
I'm talking about All Buy.

11:55.390 --> 11:56.340
That was wise.

11:56.510 --> 11:57.730
You did the right thing sending your little girlfriend

11:57.750 --> 11:58.580
out there.

11:58.750 --> 12:01.180
She's articulate and pretty.

12:01.320 --> 12:01.980
The craziest part is

12:02.150 --> 12:02.700
she thought

12:02.720 --> 12:03.610
of using a livestream

12:03.630 --> 12:04.770
for crisis PR.

12:05.120 --> 12:05.610
Right?

12:06.870 --> 12:08.530
By the way, how come

12:08.550 --> 12:09.340
her title

12:09.670 --> 12:10.530
is project lead?

12:10.600 --> 12:11.530
Weren't you the lead before?

12:12.320 --> 12:12.770
Livestream?

12:13.840 --> 12:14.130
Livestream.

12:14.630 --> 12:15.180
You didn't know?

12:23.000 --> 12:23.700
The project lead

12:23.750 --> 12:24.980
has always been me,

12:25.480 --> 12:26.060
Xu Chi.

12:30.150 --> 12:30.650
Exactly.

12:30.840 --> 12:32.420
The "All" in the All-He Digital Adaptation Fund

12:32.480 --> 12:33.980
for Senior Employees

12:34.240 --> 12:35.010
comes from All Buy,

12:35.320 --> 12:36.460
and "He" stands for Hezong.

12:36.840 --> 12:38.770
Consultant Xu Chi put together

12:38.910 --> 12:40.100
such a complete plan in no time.

12:40.270 --> 12:41.300
Hezong Consulting

12:41.360 --> 12:42.370
will take this as an opportunity.

12:45.040 --> 12:45.960
[Beauty and brains.]

12:46.160 --> 12:48.480
[The most assertive future partner in consulting.]

12:51.000 --> 12:51.600
[All Buy Project Work Group Chat]

12:51.880 --> 12:54.160
[Can't send messages in a group you've left.]

13:20.320 --> 13:21.580
Don't go online

13:22.150 --> 13:23.060
today.

13:23.910 --> 13:24.980
And stay off the work group chats.

13:25.670 --> 13:26.300
Wait for me to come back.

13:27.480 --> 13:28.770
Xinzhi, trust me.

13:29.080 --> 13:29.770
I'll do everything I can

13:29.790 --> 13:31.010
to help you.

13:31.790 --> 13:32.460
If

13:33.510 --> 13:34.700
I do something you don't like,

13:36.270 --> 13:37.250
don't be mad at me.

13:38.750 --> 13:39.530
Everything I do

13:39.550 --> 13:40.700
is for our future.

14:01.360 --> 14:03.420
You'll end up like me sooner or later.

14:04.080 --> 14:04.650
You

14:05.550 --> 14:06.730
are my payback.

14:07.840 --> 14:08.370
And she

14:09.320 --> 14:10.490
is your payback down the road.

14:13.000 --> 14:14.850
Because she is colder than you

14:15.480 --> 14:17.250
and way more ruthless.

14:17.750 --> 14:18.530
One day,

14:18.870 --> 14:20.130
she'll kick you to the curb

14:20.200 --> 14:22.300
and take your place completely.

14:27.170 --> 14:27.880
[Ye the Legend]

14:30.630 --> 14:31.610
Didn't reply to my WeChat.

14:31.670 --> 14:32.770
Won't pick up my calls either.

14:34.360 --> 14:35.650
He took melatonin yesterday.

14:35.750 --> 14:36.940
He's probably still asleep.

14:36.960 --> 14:38.130
The number you have dialed is powered off.

14:38.150 --> 14:38.610
Sorry.

14:50.250 --> 14:53.200
[Marry Me]

15:05.960 --> 15:07.180
So romantic!

15:23.390 --> 15:23.700
Hi.

15:23.870 --> 15:24.730
Can you wrap this up for me?

15:25.600 --> 15:26.340
Sorry.

15:26.440 --> 15:27.650
Our Ecuadorian roses

15:27.750 --> 15:28.530
were just all ordered

15:28.630 --> 15:29.490
by a gentleman.

15:30.120 --> 15:31.220
Really, this gentleman right here.

15:31.440 --> 15:32.460
We're wrapping them now.

15:38.120 --> 15:38.890
Mr. Shen?

15:40.440 --> 15:41.060
You're

15:41.510 --> 15:42.650
Bu Tianna's boyfriend, Zhao Heng,

15:42.720 --> 15:43.060
right?

15:43.240 --> 15:43.700
Yeah, yeah.

15:43.840 --> 15:44.490
Hello.

15:44.600 --> 15:44.890
Mr. Shen.

15:46.270 --> 15:46.890
Back from the trip?

15:47.270 --> 15:47.580
Yeah.

15:47.630 --> 15:48.490
Getting flowers for Bu Tianna?

15:50.320 --> 15:50.850
Let me tell you,

15:51.440 --> 15:52.610
that girl

15:52.750 --> 15:53.650
only likes the expensive ones.

15:54.120 --> 15:54.460
Alright then.

15:54.840 --> 15:55.890
I'll let you have nine. Enough?

15:57.080 --> 15:57.530
Thanks!

15:58.150 --> 15:58.580
No problem.

16:00.510 --> 16:00.980
So shiny.

16:02.270 --> 16:02.580
Hey,

16:03.200 --> 16:04.980
you're not proposing to Lin, are you?

16:07.670 --> 16:09.490
3.334 Carats.

16:09.870 --> 16:10.850
Means three lifetimes of love.

16:11.150 --> 16:12.100
I actually wanted to get

16:12.120 --> 16:13.250
a 13.14-carat one.

16:13.600 --> 16:14.890
But I went to the store in a hurry.

16:15.120 --> 16:15.890
They didn't have it in stock.

16:18.150 --> 16:18.580
Hurry?

16:19.200 --> 16:20.850
It's not even a special day.

16:21.080 --> 16:22.010
Why did you suddenly think

16:22.080 --> 16:23.060
of proposing to Lin?

16:26.150 --> 16:27.060
I...

16:27.600 --> 16:28.300
I guess I'm going

16:28.360 --> 16:29.460
through the change a bit early.

16:30.270 --> 16:31.060
I had a big fight

16:31.120 --> 16:31.770
with Lin yesterday.

16:32.360 --> 16:33.610
I wanna apologize to her.

16:33.870 --> 16:35.100
Don't you gotta buy flowers

16:35.200 --> 16:36.180
to apologize to a girl?

16:36.720 --> 16:37.610
Are you hoping to

16:38.120 --> 16:38.890
use this proposal

16:39.000 --> 16:40.220
to apologize to her?

16:40.790 --> 16:41.180
Yeah.

16:43.030 --> 16:44.010
From what I know about Lin,

16:44.120 --> 16:44.980
with her personality,

16:45.080 --> 16:46.100
if you pull something like that

16:46.150 --> 16:46.820
in public,

16:46.870 --> 16:48.060
you two are

16:48.720 --> 16:49.220
basically done.

16:49.670 --> 16:51.100
Because you're not proposing.

16:51.200 --> 16:52.220
You're forcing her to say yes.

16:52.320 --> 16:52.700
Especially

16:52.960 --> 16:54.340
using this one-sided gesture

16:54.440 --> 16:55.980
to cover up your problems.

16:56.360 --> 16:57.340
To me, that's just

16:58.320 --> 16:58.980
emotional blackmail.

16:59.320 --> 17:00.890
Plus, a total cop-out.

17:07.920 --> 17:09.460
Xinzhi, I'm back.

17:10.400 --> 17:11.290
Are you awake?

18:02.440 --> 18:02.940
Du.

18:03.400 --> 18:04.220
Do you know where Xinzhi is?

18:04.310 --> 18:05.290
I'm worried something happened to him.

18:11.310 --> 18:11.810
Chi,

18:12.550 --> 18:12.900
by the time

18:12.920 --> 18:13.860
you see this video...

18:16.030 --> 18:16.980
I might already be gone.

18:18.270 --> 18:18.810
Don't worry.

18:19.550 --> 18:20.180
I'm not mad that you

18:20.200 --> 18:21.620
removed me from the work group chat.

18:23.070 --> 18:23.570
I get it.

18:24.400 --> 18:25.900
You were doing everything you could to protect me.

18:26.720 --> 18:27.570
You saw that moment

18:27.640 --> 18:28.700
of weakness in me,

18:29.750 --> 18:30.660
so you stood in front of me

18:30.680 --> 18:31.730
with everything you had.

18:32.200 --> 18:33.050
Our team

18:33.960 --> 18:35.290
has never had a consultant surnamed Ye.

18:36.030 --> 18:37.980
The project lead has always been me, Xu Chi.

18:39.440 --> 18:40.220
But today,

18:41.680 --> 18:43.050
when I saw all those reports

18:43.070 --> 18:44.180
blowing up online,

18:45.750 --> 18:47.730
I had these really mixed, subtle feelings.

18:50.900 --> 18:55.580
♪Hey, that necklace♪

18:56.180 --> 18:57.800
♪I'm still wearing it close to my heart♪

18:57.880 --> 18:59.090
When I lost it,

18:59.880 --> 19:01.220
you came up with a better plan.

19:02.000 --> 19:02.900
You've become

19:02.920 --> 19:04.010
an outstanding consultant.

19:05.680 --> 19:06.220
Maybe

19:07.200 --> 19:08.090
even better than me.

19:09.720 --> 19:10.570
To be frank,

19:11.480 --> 19:12.660
I'm happy for you,

19:13.750 --> 19:14.420
but I also feel

19:15.880 --> 19:17.090
a little uneasy.

19:17.100 --> 19:18.500
♪Maybe a joke♪

19:18.860 --> 19:22.260
♪Somehow ended up being taken seriously♪

19:22.260 --> 19:25.900
♪One street, then another♪

19:26.100 --> 19:29.700
♪I didn't know what to do♪

19:30.340 --> 19:33.940
♪Suddenly, the whole world fell silent♪

19:34.020 --> 19:36.980
♪And I was left feeling uneasy♪

19:36.980 --> 19:43.100
♪Only the sound of rain was left to touch me♪

19:43.860 --> 19:47.020
♪Even sorrow grew quiet♪

19:48.480 --> 19:49.730
I asked Mr. Kai for a long leave.

19:49.740 --> 19:51.680
♪Leaving only a role that smiles while it cries♪

19:51.750 --> 19:52.250
Chi.

19:54.160 --> 19:55.090
Give me some time.

19:55.100 --> 19:56.900
♪May your blessings be worth it♪

19:56.920 --> 19:57.900
I need to figure out

19:59.000 --> 20:00.290
if I'm still cut out to be

20:00.310 --> 20:01.180
a consultant.

20:03.920 --> 20:04.810
And think about

20:05.640 --> 20:06.250
how we should be

20:07.200 --> 20:08.290
with each other going forward.

20:09.240 --> 20:10.050
Maybe one day,

20:12.350 --> 20:13.460
I'll find the answer.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.620
Do you have to collect all of these?

20:21.750 --> 20:22.490
The world

20:22.680 --> 20:24.050
is made of

20:24.070 --> 20:24.620
108 elements.

20:26.070 --> 20:27.220
When I was a kid, I was naive.

20:28.000 --> 20:28.980
I thought if I collected them all,

20:29.000 --> 20:30.220
I'd have the whole world.

20:31.720 --> 20:32.660
Later, I learned

20:33.310 --> 20:34.460
some elements are dangerous.

20:35.400 --> 20:35.940
I'd never be able to

20:35.960 --> 20:37.010
collect them all in my lifetime.

20:38.750 --> 20:39.250
Can I

20:41.110 --> 20:42.220
share my world

20:43.000 --> 20:43.810
with you now?

20:45.100 --> 20:51.180
♪I'm still wearing it close to my heart♪

20:52.300 --> 20:55.940
♪Suddenly, the whole world fell silent♪

20:56.270 --> 20:57.420
They all abandoned me.

20:57.420 --> 20:58.940
♪And I was left feeling uneasy♪

20:58.940 --> 21:05.020
♪Only the sound of rain was left to touch me♪

21:05.860 --> 21:08.980
♪Even sorrow grew quiet♪

21:09.060 --> 21:14.220
♪Leaving only a role that smiles while it cries♪

21:14.260 --> 21:18.780
♪May your blessings be worth it♪

21:19.260 --> 21:22.620
♪Suddenly, the whole world fell silent♪

21:22.700 --> 21:27.540
♪Leaving only a role that smiles while it cries♪

21:27.700 --> 21:32.580
♪May your blessings be worth it♪

21:43.240 --> 21:43.940
You're back.

21:44.000 --> 21:44.980
I already told you not to come again.

21:45.480 --> 21:45.860
Just leave.

21:47.110 --> 21:48.290
No, let me explain...

21:48.480 --> 21:48.900
Wait.

21:50.880 --> 21:51.530
What happened to your neck?

21:56.680 --> 21:57.530
It's its blood.

22:01.510 --> 22:03.380
I made you an old hen soup.

22:03.750 --> 22:05.090
I came to apologize.

22:05.350 --> 22:05.860
I picked

22:05.880 --> 22:06.900
this old hen myself

22:06.960 --> 22:07.900
at my friend's farm.

22:08.110 --> 22:09.010
It's over three years old.

22:09.110 --> 22:09.460
My friend said

22:09.480 --> 22:10.490
it laid over a thousand eggs.

22:10.720 --> 22:12.490
Wait, what is this game you're playing?

22:12.680 --> 22:13.980
Trying to make an example of the chicken?

22:15.240 --> 22:16.460
That... that's not what I meant.

22:17.510 --> 22:19.180
I... I'm not warning you.

22:19.310 --> 22:19.570
I mean,

22:19.720 --> 22:21.140
if anything, I should be warned.

22:21.550 --> 22:22.660
No, that's not the point.

22:23.720 --> 22:24.860
The point is I made

22:24.880 --> 22:26.220
this hen soup myself for you.

22:26.550 --> 22:27.940
I put in a lot of dates,

22:28.070 --> 22:28.770
goji berries,

22:28.920 --> 22:30.220
and two really big ginseng roots.

22:30.270 --> 22:30.810
It's good for...

22:30.830 --> 22:31.570
Stop your nonsense.

22:31.590 --> 22:32.180
Just... just go.

22:32.200 --> 22:32.860
Leave.

22:33.000 --> 22:33.860
No, let me expla...

22:33.920 --> 22:35.010
Just go!

22:35.070 --> 22:36.490
I... I... I really came to...

22:36.640 --> 22:38.180
No, just let me explain.

22:38.200 --> 22:38.620
Go!

22:44.590 --> 22:45.180
What's this?

22:48.350 --> 22:49.010
Nothing.

22:49.240 --> 22:49.980
What are you trying to do?

22:50.070 --> 22:50.940
I'm not trying to do anything.

22:51.200 --> 22:51.620
Shen Jin.

22:51.680 --> 22:52.010
Here!

22:52.720 --> 22:52.940
Leave.

22:52.960 --> 22:53.250
Got it.

23:03.070 --> 23:04.380
You won't even take the soup.

23:05.070 --> 23:05.900
Guess I'll have to

23:05.960 --> 23:07.700
try the last resort.

23:13.200 --> 23:14.380
3.334 Carats.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.250
Means three lifetimes of love.

23:15.310 --> 23:16.220
That's how they do it in dramas.

23:16.350 --> 23:17.530
If you don't mind, just take it.

23:28.070 --> 23:29.050
You won't drink the soup?

23:29.160 --> 23:29.980
And you won't take the ring?

23:30.270 --> 23:31.140
You gotta pick one.

23:37.720 --> 23:38.810
- Take the ring. - Take the ring.

23:45.400 --> 23:46.570
Get up now.

23:46.750 --> 23:47.220
Get in here.

23:48.830 --> 23:49.330
Get in.

23:50.790 --> 23:51.770
So embarrassing.

23:53.270 --> 23:54.220
How can I ever show my face again?

23:54.920 --> 23:55.290
Hey,

23:55.830 --> 23:57.220
forget about showing your face for a second.

23:58.270 --> 23:59.420
You still haven't made your choice.

23:59.510 --> 24:01.180
Why are you on your knees again? Get up...

24:01.200 --> 24:02.140
Just hear me out first!

24:02.160 --> 24:03.050
Let me finish.

24:12.920 --> 24:14.010
I really thought about everything

24:14.070 --> 24:14.900
I did wrong.

24:15.590 --> 24:16.730
I need to tell you now.

24:17.350 --> 24:17.770
First,

24:19.030 --> 24:19.620
I run my mouth.

24:21.270 --> 24:21.700
I shouldn't have been

24:21.750 --> 24:22.940
putting down your job all the time.

24:24.200 --> 24:24.570
Second,

24:25.160 --> 24:26.250
I shouldn't have dragged you

24:26.310 --> 24:27.770
to activities you're not into.

24:28.640 --> 24:29.770
But I just wanted to

24:29.880 --> 24:31.180
help you unwind.

24:35.160 --> 24:35.570
Third,

24:36.960 --> 24:37.770
I shouldn't have disrespected

24:37.880 --> 24:38.530
your job.

24:38.830 --> 24:39.940
I shouldn't have told you to quit.

24:41.160 --> 24:42.330
But I really was thinking

24:42.400 --> 24:43.090
about your health.

24:44.030 --> 24:44.380
Yeah.

24:44.590 --> 24:45.700
None of this matters now.

24:45.750 --> 24:46.900
It's all my fault. I...

24:48.680 --> 24:49.380
And I shouldn't have

24:50.680 --> 24:51.380
made you feel like

24:52.000 --> 24:52.860
I had no plan

24:52.920 --> 24:53.660
for our future.

24:55.000 --> 24:55.490
The truth is,

24:55.550 --> 24:56.620
I do have a plan.

24:57.350 --> 24:58.940
But you just got divorced.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.860
I'm afraid you have baggage when it comes to

25:00.880 --> 25:01.530
family life.

25:02.920 --> 25:03.980
I've actually thought through everything

25:04.070 --> 25:05.250
for our future!

25:10.160 --> 25:10.490
Never mind.

25:10.550 --> 25:11.290
I don't even know why I'm

25:11.310 --> 25:12.380
telling you all this now.

25:13.030 --> 25:14.140
I actually came here today

25:14.200 --> 25:14.700
to make you...

25:15.440 --> 25:16.460
Just... just pick one.

25:16.680 --> 25:17.530
I'm begging you.

25:34.270 --> 25:35.620
Adults don't make choices.

25:36.880 --> 25:37.810
Can't I just pick both?

25:38.000 --> 25:39.380
No! You can only pick one...

25:49.550 --> 25:50.460
You're picking both?

26:22.880 --> 26:24.050
Can you make it three?

26:24.590 --> 26:25.250
What do you mean?

26:27.640 --> 26:28.460
Don't forget about me.

27:02.340 --> 27:06.340
[Lushui Lake Digital Economy Annual Conference]

27:21.830 --> 27:23.860
This is on me. I let him down.

27:25.160 --> 27:25.860
I knew

27:25.880 --> 27:27.420
all he wanted was to apologize to Mr. Liu.

27:28.440 --> 27:29.730
But the second Mr. Kai said

27:30.200 --> 27:31.770
another partner would replace him,

27:34.030 --> 27:34.770
I wavered.

27:36.550 --> 27:38.050
Because my biggest fear

27:39.960 --> 27:41.050
is being replaced.

27:44.240 --> 27:45.140
All I thought about

27:45.240 --> 27:46.220
was solving the All Buy mess

27:46.270 --> 27:47.570
in the safest way.

27:47.830 --> 27:48.290
But I never

27:48.310 --> 27:49.530
looked at it from his side.

27:50.270 --> 27:51.050
So

27:52.200 --> 27:53.810
whether as his assistant, his subordinate,

27:53.880 --> 27:54.490
or

27:56.310 --> 27:57.010
his fiancée,

27:58.030 --> 27:58.900
I am

27:59.830 --> 28:00.940
a total traitor.

28:02.070 --> 28:03.420
So when he walked away disappointed,

28:03.440 --> 28:04.010
I...

28:05.240 --> 28:05.900
I've got nothing to say.

28:06.830 --> 28:07.250
I don't even

28:07.270 --> 28:07.980
feel like I have

28:08.000 --> 28:09.010
the right to go after him.

28:13.790 --> 28:14.860
It's not that serious.

28:15.270 --> 28:16.940
In the video, he just said

28:17.030 --> 28:18.140
he needed to clear his head.

28:18.440 --> 28:19.570
He'll be back soon.

28:20.960 --> 28:22.140
He won't come back for me.

28:25.880 --> 28:26.980
That video...

28:27.790 --> 28:29.460
He only gave me an out because he was worried

28:29.680 --> 28:30.770
about me and wanted to comfort me.

28:31.750 --> 28:33.140
Du later told me

28:33.590 --> 28:34.660
Xinzhi's dad

28:34.680 --> 28:35.940
used to be a quality inspector too.

28:36.960 --> 28:38.490
After getting laid off in the 1990s,

28:38.550 --> 28:39.660
he borrowed money to do business.

28:40.110 --> 28:40.860
Then

28:42.720 --> 28:43.900
he jumped off a rooftop

28:43.960 --> 28:44.700
in front of Xinzhi.

28:46.400 --> 28:47.220
So Xinzhi's scared of heights.

28:48.880 --> 28:49.980
Even so,

28:52.400 --> 28:53.220
he'd always stand up there

28:53.240 --> 28:54.700
with me just because I loved

28:55.960 --> 28:57.090
the view from the rooftop.

28:59.720 --> 29:01.420
But I never once thought

29:02.960 --> 29:03.530
about

29:03.550 --> 29:04.620
what was behind his fear.

29:13.720 --> 29:14.140
Okay.

29:15.350 --> 29:16.250
Look at it this way, Xu.

29:17.480 --> 29:18.180
You got promoted.

29:18.640 --> 29:19.620
You've got your own team.

29:19.790 --> 29:21.330
And the project's about to deliver.

29:21.790 --> 29:22.660
Isn't that great?

29:23.000 --> 29:23.700
Yeah.

29:23.790 --> 29:24.660
It's great.

29:25.070 --> 29:25.900
In a few years,

29:25.920 --> 29:27.140
you'll make partner.

29:27.270 --> 29:27.770
Look at me.

29:28.640 --> 29:30.180
I don't even know how long I'll be

29:30.240 --> 29:30.940
stuck as director

29:30.960 --> 29:31.660
on this new project.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.330
Don't stress.

29:33.920 --> 29:34.530
Did you know?

29:34.790 --> 29:35.530
Her dad's actually

29:35.680 --> 29:37.220
teaching her how to

29:37.240 --> 29:37.940
run the company now.

29:38.310 --> 29:39.010
In two years,

29:39.640 --> 29:41.730
she'll be running the new energy subsidiary on her own.

29:42.960 --> 29:44.010
So your problems are all solved.

29:45.070 --> 29:46.180
The biggest problem now is me.

29:47.030 --> 29:48.330
I wanna get into real business.

29:49.440 --> 29:51.220
Master Xu, you know everyone.

29:51.510 --> 29:52.700
Help me get a referral, please.

29:54.480 --> 29:57.090
Sure. I'll refer you right now.

29:58.240 --> 29:58.770
Ms. Bu,

30:00.160 --> 30:01.330
what do you think of this guy?

30:06.750 --> 30:09.290
Ms. Bu, what do you think of me?

30:09.880 --> 30:10.730
What do you want?

30:13.550 --> 30:15.460
I wouldn't dare want anything.

30:46.310 --> 30:47.010
I'm fine.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.140
It's okay.

31:18.060 --> 31:22.500
[Courtyard No. 92, Yong'an Road]

31:22.510 --> 31:22.860
Leaving?

31:25.070 --> 31:26.530
Hua, you're heading out? Take care.

31:35.440 --> 31:35.940
Done.

31:36.960 --> 31:39.050
Done. Just fifteen minutes.

31:39.160 --> 31:39.860
You gotta be out by then.

31:39.920 --> 31:40.700
Great.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.530
I couldn't get the place for you.

31:42.640 --> 31:43.330
But I had to make good

31:43.350 --> 31:44.380
on that big bonus you gave me.

31:44.960 --> 31:46.180
I heard from the city

31:46.200 --> 31:47.530
that after reinforcing the houses affected

31:47.550 --> 31:48.090
by the collapse,

31:48.350 --> 31:49.010
they're letting one person per household

31:49.030 --> 31:49.810
go in during designated times

31:49.830 --> 31:50.530
to grab essentials,

31:50.790 --> 31:51.730
so I signed you up for it.

31:52.070 --> 31:52.860
Thank you so much.

31:53.550 --> 31:54.290
I'll head in now.

31:56.880 --> 31:57.330
Hello.

31:57.720 --> 31:58.090
Hi.

31:59.880 --> 32:01.330
Okay. It's pretty dangerous in there.

32:01.440 --> 32:02.250
Quick in, quick out.

33:21.030 --> 33:22.250
Then let's buy this place.

33:24.590 --> 33:25.810
I don't have that kind of money.

33:26.310 --> 33:27.010
You've got me.

33:28.590 --> 33:29.660
Give me a chance

33:30.240 --> 33:31.980
to do what a boyfriend should do.

33:33.550 --> 33:34.180
Alright?

33:39.510 --> 33:39.980
Xu.

33:40.830 --> 33:41.290
Time to go.

33:42.070 --> 33:43.290
The staff outside are rushing us.

33:44.480 --> 33:44.900
Okay.

33:46.400 --> 33:46.940
Wait, Xu.

33:49.960 --> 33:51.330
How about you take this?

33:51.680 --> 33:52.810
Just as a keepsake.

33:53.590 --> 33:55.330
If this place really gets torn down next week,

33:55.680 --> 33:57.140
there'll be nothing left.

34:06.160 --> 34:07.250
Take a few photos.

34:07.830 --> 34:08.530
Hurry down.

34:22.280 --> 34:24.090
I used to think this apartment

34:24.110 --> 34:25.260
was worth giving everything for.

34:25.800 --> 34:26.650
But only now

34:26.670 --> 34:27.860
do I finally get it...

34:29.710 --> 34:30.740
I don't get anything at all.

35:07.230 --> 35:07.940
Xinzhi?

35:10.510 --> 35:11.740
It's really you!

35:12.840 --> 35:13.610
Ikkyu-san?

35:14.360 --> 35:15.460
What are you doing in Iraq?

35:15.840 --> 35:16.340
I

35:16.360 --> 35:17.610
even consulted you before.

35:17.630 --> 35:19.260
You forgot?

35:20.000 --> 35:21.820
The refinery I'm in charge of building

35:22.190 --> 35:23.610
is 200 kilometers that way.

35:24.070 --> 35:24.690
I'm on leave today.

35:24.710 --> 35:26.050
So I brought some colleagues out to look around.

35:26.670 --> 35:28.380
What about you? Here on business?

35:29.000 --> 35:30.420
I've got nothing going on lately.

35:30.440 --> 35:30.980
Just taking a break.

35:31.710 --> 35:32.300
A break?

35:33.280 --> 35:33.780
You're skipping

35:33.800 --> 35:35.690
the Blue Hole you've always wanted to see,

35:35.840 --> 35:37.460
and coming to this godforsaken desert?

35:38.510 --> 35:39.650
You look exactly like you did

35:40.070 --> 35:41.860
back when you found out

35:41.880 --> 35:42.530
your ex-wife

35:42.550 --> 35:43.690
was dead set

35:43.710 --> 35:44.260
on emigrating.

35:46.630 --> 35:47.300
Heartbroken again?

35:50.840 --> 35:51.420
I'm really fine.

35:52.590 --> 35:53.940
Just out here clearing my head.

35:54.760 --> 35:55.530
Liar.

35:56.000 --> 35:57.740
Didn't you used to brag to me

35:57.800 --> 35:59.420
on WeChat about your girlfriend?

36:00.230 --> 36:01.260
And now you're out here alone?

36:08.110 --> 36:09.490
I remember she said

36:09.840 --> 36:11.130
the Tower of Babel was the place

36:11.150 --> 36:11.980
she wanted to go most.

36:13.960 --> 36:14.740
So I came to see

36:15.880 --> 36:16.570
what's so magical

36:17.440 --> 36:18.420
about this place

36:19.360 --> 36:20.090
that it drew her in.

36:22.230 --> 36:22.900
Got your answer?

36:24.800 --> 36:25.210
No.

36:25.880 --> 36:27.460
But after some time alone,

36:29.760 --> 36:31.420
I think maybe

36:32.070 --> 36:33.090
my decision to leave

36:33.590 --> 36:34.490
was a bit impulsive.

36:37.110 --> 36:37.900
Honestly,

36:39.630 --> 36:40.460
I still haven't figured it out.

36:41.800 --> 36:42.530
Regret it?

36:43.150 --> 36:43.650
No.

36:44.190 --> 36:45.570
But I think you do.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.530
You used to smile a lot.

36:49.230 --> 36:50.740
But since you saw me just now,

36:50.760 --> 36:51.780
you've barely smiled.

36:56.280 --> 36:57.690
When I first got here,

36:58.000 --> 36:59.530
I read a travel guide.

36:59.800 --> 37:00.340
It told

37:00.360 --> 37:01.170
a story.

37:01.230 --> 37:02.780
It said in ancient times,

37:02.800 --> 37:04.740
people wanted to build

37:04.840 --> 37:06.010
a tower reaching for the heavens.

37:07.000 --> 37:08.090
But they didn't get

37:08.110 --> 37:09.300
God's permission first.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.420
So God got angry

37:10.550 --> 37:11.650
and cast a spell,

37:11.840 --> 37:12.740
so everyone

37:12.920 --> 37:14.010
spoke different languages.

37:14.510 --> 37:14.740
That way,

37:14.760 --> 37:15.820
they couldn't communicate.

37:16.710 --> 37:17.130
And of course,

37:17.320 --> 37:18.570
the tower never got built.

37:27.630 --> 37:28.130
Xinzhi.

37:28.960 --> 37:29.980
What I mean is,

37:31.230 --> 37:31.900
if you and she

37:31.920 --> 37:33.260
have problems,

37:33.590 --> 37:35.010
why can't you just talk it out?

37:35.960 --> 37:36.780
Aren't you speaking

37:37.480 --> 37:38.690
the same language?

38:05.480 --> 38:06.530
While I'm away this week,

38:06.630 --> 38:07.460
I'm leaving the mentoring

38:07.480 --> 38:08.260
to you.

38:08.880 --> 38:09.490
See if

38:09.760 --> 38:11.170
you can spot a few with real potential.

38:12.440 --> 38:13.920
[Tina]

38:18.550 --> 38:18.860
Hello?

38:19.630 --> 38:21.010
You just sent a WeChat message

38:21.110 --> 38:22.820
and took off without even calling.

38:23.280 --> 38:24.980
You've never even been outside Asia,

38:25.070 --> 38:26.740
and you're going straight to the Blue...?

38:27.000 --> 38:27.530
Blue Hole.

38:27.670 --> 38:28.570
Blue... Blue Hole.

38:30.190 --> 38:31.420
I finally got some time off.

38:31.630 --> 38:32.650
And I booked a local tour.

38:32.760 --> 38:33.420
It's not that scary.

38:34.510 --> 38:35.260
Chi, how about this?

38:35.280 --> 38:36.260
Let me recommend another place.

38:36.320 --> 38:37.650
The Maldives! Way less jet lag.

38:38.030 --> 38:38.820
But I only wanna go

38:38.840 --> 38:39.780
to the Blue Hole in Dahab.

38:40.550 --> 38:41.130
I wanna see

38:41.150 --> 38:42.010
how beautiful it is,

38:42.550 --> 38:44.010
so that he can't stop thinking about it.

38:47.760 --> 38:48.260
Okay, okay.

38:48.320 --> 38:49.610
Your flight's delayed anyway.

38:49.630 --> 38:51.130
Just wait for me at the café

38:51.230 --> 38:52.650
by Exit 12 on the arrivals level.

38:53.000 --> 38:54.010
Zhao Heng and I will be right there.

38:54.150 --> 38:55.210
We'll talk when we meet up.

38:55.280 --> 38:55.610
Alright?

39:12.050 --> 39:22.880
[Explore Dahab's Blue Miracle; Dive into the Deep Blue]

39:41.020 --> 39:44.220
♪I can forget you♪

39:46.820 --> 39:49.980
♪When the storm has finally passed♪

39:52.820 --> 39:58.500
♪When my heart no longer carries your trace♪

40:05.260 --> 40:08.420
♪I want to forget you♪

40:11.460 --> 40:14.820
♪The red light stops me at the crossroads♪

40:17.460 --> 40:23.140
♪Yet I still wish to linger in your eyes♪

40:27.500 --> 40:30.260
♪Back to the days gone by♪

40:30.980 --> 40:33.140
♪Nothing can replace♪

40:33.220 --> 40:35.780
♪The heartbeat you stirred within me♪

40:35.860 --> 40:39.700
♪It still has no expiration date♪

40:43.300 --> 40:45.180
♪But why♪

40:45.700 --> 40:48.540
♪Time has turned into ruins♪

40:49.020 --> 40:51.820
♪You left me standing here♪

40:52.020 --> 40:56.420
♪I am the ruins you left behind♪

41:13.020 --> 41:14.940
♪I look upon this unfamiliar face of mine♪

41:14.940 --> 41:15.490
- Sorry. - Sorry.

41:19.300 --> 41:22.740
♪Still carrying the expressions of you

41:25.180 --> 41:30.420
♪How could another name ever replace yours♪

41:35.180 --> 41:37.860
♪Back to the days gone by♪

41:38.580 --> 41:40.900
♪Nothing can replace it♪

41:41.100 --> 41:43.660
♪A butterfly's wings begin to flutter♪

41:43.740 --> 41:47.500
♪Where waves remain deep beneath the sea♪

41:50.980 --> 41:53.500
♪Nothing can replace it♪

41:53.580 --> 41:56.060
♪Time has turned to ruins♪

41:56.660 --> 41:59.420
♪I keep you deep within my heart♪

41:59.980 --> 42:05.660
♪Forever beautiful through all eternity♪

42:20.260 --> 42:25.180
[You Are Irreplaceable]

42:40.460 --> 42:45.340
♪Orange sky at dusk; the evening breeze is waiting♪

42:45.620 --> 42:50.500
♪The crowd at the crossing suddenly scatters♪

42:50.740 --> 42:59.060
♪This world moves too fast, yet you walk slowly toward me♪

43:01.380 --> 43:06.300
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

43:06.460 --> 43:11.380
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

43:11.420 --> 43:15.980
♪Last time you had something left unsaid, right?♪

43:16.220 --> 43:21.100
♪Why did you stop again?♪

43:21.700 --> 43:26.340
♪We keep moving like the stream, never resting♪

43:27.060 --> 43:31.420
♪Through the muddy fields, rushing toward the sea♪

43:31.460 --> 43:36.460
♪I know you'll be waiting there♪

43:36.780 --> 43:41.660
♪Together with me♪

43:42.420 --> 43:47.300
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

43:47.820 --> 43:52.380
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

43:52.420 --> 43:56.980
♪You steal glances at me. You like me, right?♪

43:57.260 --> 44:02.140
♪Stop running away♪

44:23.260 --> 44:28.420
♪The sky slowly brightens, falling into our eyes♪

44:28.580 --> 44:33.420
♪The wind gradually stops, and finally it clears up♪

44:33.700 --> 44:38.740
♪The evening breeze brushes past your shoulder, and you turn your head♪

44:39.620 --> 44:44.740
♪You're irreplaceable♪

44:44.740 --> 44:45.740
MkvDrama.net
